{
  "video_id": "pyH_AbQSqKY",
  "language": "en",
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen,",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "my dear friends,",
      "start": 1.96,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "brothers and sisters in the pursuit of a",
      "start": 4.04,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "better tomorrow.",
      "start": 6.28,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Gather close with me today because I",
      "start": 8.56,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "want to speak straight to your heart",
      "start": 10.52,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "about the one skill that can unlock",
      "start": 13.04,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "doors you never even knew existed.",
      "start": 15.32,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to talk to you about training",
      "start": 18.76,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "your mouth to talk English.",
      "start": 20.76,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Not just learning it from books or apps",
      "start": 24.0,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "or classrooms,",
      "start": 26.2,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "but truly training your mouth, your",
      "start": 27.76,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "tongue, your lips, your voice, your",
      "start": 30.28,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "entire being to speak this language with",
      "start": 33.52,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "confidence, with power, with the kind of",
      "start": 36.32,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "fluency that makes people stop and",
      "start": 39.52,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "listen.",
      "start": 42.16,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "This is not some fancy lecture.",
      "start": 43.84,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a call to arms for every one of",
      "start": 46.36,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "you who has ever felt that knot in your",
      "start": 48.72,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "stomach when you wanted to speak, but",
      "start": 51.04,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "the words just wouldn't come out right.",
      "start": 54.28,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "This is for the student who dreams of",
      "start": 56.6,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "studying abroad,",
      "start": 58.12,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "for the professional stuck in a job that",
      "start": 59.84,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "feels too small,",
      "start": 61.8,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "for the young man or woman in a small",
      "start": 63.68,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "town who knows deep down there is a",
      "start": 65.68,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "bigger world waiting,",
      "start": 67.84,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "if only they could express themselves",
      "start": 69.8,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "clearly.",
      "start": 71.68,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, we are going to train that mouth",
      "start": 73.48,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "of yours",
      "start": 75.48,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "because once your mouth learns to speak",
      "start": 76.88,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "English fluently, your life will never",
      "start": 79.2,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "be the same again.",
      "start": 82.36,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me paint a picture for you.",
      "start": 84.52,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine waking up tomorrow morning,",
      "start": 87.0,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "looking in the mirror,",
      "start": 89.76,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "and instead of hesitating,",
      "start": 91.52,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "you start describing your day out loud",
      "start": 93.68,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "in perfect flowing English.",
      "start": 96.16,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No more stumbling over simple sentences.",
      "start": 98.96,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "No more translating in your head from",
      "start": 102.16,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "your mother tongue and losing the",
      "start": 104.2,
      "duration": 2.68
    },
    {
      "text": "rhythm.",
      "start": 105.6,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Just pure, natural English pouring out",
      "start": 106.88,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "like you were born to it.",
      "start": 110.04,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "That is not a fantasy.",
      "start": 112.4,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the result of deliberate daily",
      "start": 114.52,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "training.",
      "start": 117.12,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Your mouth is a muscle, my friends. Just",
      "start": 118.72,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "like the muscles in your arms grow",
      "start": 121.16,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "stronger when you lift weights every",
      "start": 122.84,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "day,",
      "start": 125.08,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "your mouth grows stronger, sharper, and",
      "start": 126.2,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "more confident when you train it",
      "start": 129.56,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "relentlessly to speak English. And I am",
      "start": 131.48,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "here to tell you exactly how to do it,",
      "start": 134.76,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "why it matters more than you can",
      "start": 137.88,
      "duration": 6.44
    },
    {
      "text": "imagine, and why you must start today,",
      "start": 139.8,
      "duration": 7.68
    },
    {
      "text": "not tomorrow, not next week, but right",
      "start": 144.32,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "now.",
      "start": 147.48,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Think about where you are right now.",
      "start": 149.16,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Many of you come from places where",
      "start": 151.8,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "English is not the first language spoken",
      "start": 153.6,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "at home.",
      "start": 155.6,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You grew up hearing it on television, in",
      "start": 156.96,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "songs, in movies, but when it came time",
      "start": 159.52,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "to open your mouth and speak it",
      "start": 163.16,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself,",
      "start": 164.8,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "fear crept in.",
      "start": 166.32,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Fear of sounding funny,",
      "start": 168.4,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "fear of making mistakes, fear of being",
      "start": 170.52,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "laughed at.",
      "start": 173.52,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I know that fear because I have lived",
      "start": 175.32,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "it.",
      "start": 177.56,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I remember standing in front of my first",
      "start": 178.8,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "English class years ago,",
      "start": 181.0,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "heart pounding like a drum, mouth dry,",
      "start": 183.64,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "words frozen somewhere between my brain",
      "start": 187.72,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "and my tongue.",
      "start": 190.36,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "But I refused to stay silent. I decided",
      "start": 192.16,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "that day that my mouth would learn to",
      "start": 195.48,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "speak this language the way a champion",
      "start": 197.68,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "trains for a fight.",
      "start": 200.08,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "And that decision changed everything.",
      "start": 202.44,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It opened jobs I never thought I could",
      "start": 206.0,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "get. It let me travel to countries where",
      "start": 208.08,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "people understood me instantly.",
      "start": 210.8,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "It gave me friends from every corner of",
      "start": 213.6,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "the world. And most importantly, it gave",
      "start": 215.68,
      "duration": 6.92
    },
    {
      "text": "me a voice that no one could ignore.",
      "start": 219.04,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So, why English?",
      "start": 222.6,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Why this particular language?",
      "start": 224.52,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Because in today's world, English is the",
      "start": 227.4,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "bridge.",
      "start": 229.88,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "It is the language of opportunity, of",
      "start": 231.16,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "science, of technology, of business, of",
      "start": 233.48,
      "duration": 6.8
    },
    {
      "text": "dreams that stretch beyond borders.",
      "start": 236.8,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Whether you want to work in a",
      "start": 240.28,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "multinational company, start your own",
      "start": 241.64,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "business online, study at a top",
      "start": 244.36,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "university, or simply watch your",
      "start": 246.88,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "favorite movies and understand every",
      "start": 249.36,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "joke without subtitles,",
      "start": 251.6,
      "duration": 5.359
    },
    {
      "text": "English is the key.",
      "start": 254.12,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "But here is the truth most people never",
      "start": 256.959,
      "duration": 3.521
    },
    {
      "text": "tell you.",
      "start": 258.88,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Reading English is easy.",
      "start": 260.48,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Writing it is manageable.",
      "start": 263.08,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "But speaking it fluently, with",
      "start": 265.68,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "confidence and speed and emotion,",
      "start": 267.68,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "that is the real game changer. That is",
      "start": 270.68,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "what separates those who dream from",
      "start": 273.6,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "those who achieve.",
      "start": 275.52,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "And the only way to get there is to",
      "start": 277.2,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "train your mouth every single day",
      "start": 279.08,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "without fail.",
      "start": 281.8,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Let us break this down step by step",
      "start": 283.84,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "because I want you to leave here today",
      "start": 285.68,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "with a clear plan, not just inspiration.",
      "start": 287.48,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "First, you must understand that your",
      "start": 291.16,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "mouth needs daily practice. Not once a",
      "start": 293.32,
      "duration": 7.36
    },
    {
      "text": "week, not when you feel like it, every",
      "start": 296.96,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "single day.",
      "start": 300.68,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Start small.",
      "start": 302.68,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Stand in front of your mirror for 10",
      "start": 304.36,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "minutes every morning and describe what",
      "start": 306.32,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "you see.",
      "start": 308.2,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk about your face, your clothes, your",
      "start": 309.56,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "plans for the day. Say it out loud.",
      "start": 311.88,
      "duration": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, I'm going to crush my goals.",
      "start": 315.32,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, I will speak English with power",
      "start": 318.36,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "and clarity.",
      "start": 320.6,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Feel the words form on your tongue.",
      "start": 322.28,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice how your lips move, how your jaw",
      "start": 325.24,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "opens and closes. Record yourself on",
      "start": 328.16,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "your phone. Yes, you will hate the sound",
      "start": 330.84,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "of your own voice at first. Everyone",
      "start": 334.36,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "does.",
      "start": 336.72,
      "duration": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "But listen back.",
      "start": 337.8,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice where you stumble.",
      "start": 339.52,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice where your accent makes a word",
      "start": 341.76,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "unclear. Then repeat it again and again",
      "start": 343.92,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "until it flows smoothly.",
      "start": 346.6,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "This is training.",
      "start": 349.32,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "This is how athletes become champions.",
      "start": 351.0,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "They repeat the same movement thousands",
      "start": 353.44,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "of times until it becomes automatic.",
      "start": 355.64,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Your mouth must do the same with English",
      "start": 358.76,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "sounds. The th sound, the r and l",
      "start": 360.84,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "distinction, the way native speakers",
      "start": 364.48,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "link words together without pausing.",
      "start": 367.12,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "These are not impossible.",
      "start": 369.96,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "They are muscles you have not yet",
      "start": 372.32,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "strengthened.",
      "start": 374.36,
      "duration": 3.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Train them like you train for a",
      "start": 375.76,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "marathon.",
      "start": 377.44,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Every morning, pick five difficult",
      "start": 379.04,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "sentences and speak them slowly, then",
      "start": 381.28,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "faster, then with emotion. Pretend you",
      "start": 384.08,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "are addressing a crowd of thousands.",
      "start": 387.04,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Feel the power rising in your chest.",
      "start": 389.84,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Your voice is a tool, and tools get",
      "start": 392.8,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "sharper with use.",
      "start": 395.76,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "If you only practice once in a while,",
      "start": 397.92,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "your mouth will stay weak. But if you",
      "start": 400.48,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "commit to 30 minutes every day, rain or",
      "start": 403.24,
      "duration": 6.76
    },
    {
      "text": "shine, tired or energetic, your mouth",
      "start": 406.76,
      "duration": 7.04
    },
    {
      "text": "will transform. I promise you that.",
      "start": 410.0,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, some of you are thinking, \"But I",
      "start": 413.8,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "make mistakes. People will laugh.\"",
      "start": 415.88,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me stop you right there.",
      "start": 418.48,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Mistakes are not enemies. They are your",
      "start": 420.68,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "best teachers.",
      "start": 422.72,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Every champion athlete has fallen",
      "start": 424.72,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "thousands of times before standing tall.",
      "start": 427.88,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Every great speaker has mispronounced",
      "start": 430.92,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "words and felt embarrassed.",
      "start": 433.64,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "But they kept going.",
      "start": 435.96,
      "duration": 6.36
    },
    {
      "text": "The secret is to speak anyway.",
      "start": 438.32,
      "duration": 7.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak to yourself. Speak to your family,",
      "start": 442.32,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "even if they do not understand. Speak to",
      "start": 445.56,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "strangers online in language exchange",
      "start": 448.56,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "apps. Join groups where people are",
      "start": 451.0,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "practicing English together.",
      "start": 453.76,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "The more you speak, the less those",
      "start": 456.0,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "mistakes will matter because your",
      "start": 458.68,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "confidence will grow faster than your",
      "start": 460.84,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "errors can slow you down.",
      "start": 463.44,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I have seen shy students who could",
      "start": 466.44,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "barely say hello turn into powerful",
      "start": 468.44,
      "duration": 6.16
    },
    {
      "text": "communicators in just 6 months because",
      "start": 471.56,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "they trained their mouths relentlessly.",
      "start": 474.6,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "They did not wait for perfect",
      "start": 478.28,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "conditions. They created them.",
      "start": 479.84,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me tell you a story that will stay",
      "start": 483.84,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "with you.",
      "start": 485.76,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "There was a young man from a small",
      "start": 487.32,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "village, much like many of you, perhaps.",
      "start": 489.08,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "His name was Ahmed. He dreamed of",
      "start": 492.36,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "becoming an engineer.",
      "start": 494.64,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "But every interview he went to, his",
      "start": 496.72,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "English failed him.",
      "start": 499.0,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "He could write reports beautifully, but",
      "start": 500.76,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "when the interviewer asked him to",
      "start": 503.04,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "explain his ideas,",
      "start": 504.56,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "his mouth froze.",
      "start": 506.56,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "He felt small.",
      "start": 509.0,
      "duration": 4.159
    },
    {
      "text": "He felt worthless.",
      "start": 510.72,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "One day, someone told him the same thing",
      "start": 513.159,
      "duration": 4.081
    },
    {
      "text": "I am telling you now.",
      "start": 515.4,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Train your mouth.",
      "start": 517.24,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Ahmed started a simple routine.",
      "start": 520.12,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Every morning at 5:00 a.m. before the",
      "start": 523.28,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "village woke up, he would walk to the",
      "start": 525.72,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "fields and speak English out loud to the",
      "start": 528.0,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "rising sun.",
      "start": 530.88,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "He described the crops, the weather, his",
      "start": 532.72,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "future projects, his dreams.",
      "start": 535.84,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "He recorded every session.",
      "start": 538.28,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "At night, he would listen and correct",
      "start": 540.88,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "himself.",
      "start": 543.2,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "He practiced tongue twisters until his",
      "start": 544.4,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "mouth hurt.",
      "start": 546.68,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "She sells seashells by the seashore over",
      "start": 548.2,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "and over.",
      "start": 551.96,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "He watched English videos and repeated",
      "start": 553.68,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "every word exactly as the speaker said",
      "start": 556.16,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "it. Shadowing, they call it. He became",
      "start": 558.96,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "the shadow of fluent speakers.",
      "start": 562.0,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Within 3 months, his mouth had changed.",
      "start": 564.84,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "His tongue moved differently. His",
      "start": 568.08,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "confidence soared. Six months later, he",
      "start": 570.72,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "walked into the biggest company",
      "start": 573.36,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "interview in the city",
      "start": 574.88,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "and spoke with such clarity and power",
      "start": 576.64,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "that the interviewers offered him the",
      "start": 579.84,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "job on the spot.",
      "start": 581.68,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, Ahmed leads international",
      "start": 584.04,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "projects and travels the world.",
      "start": 585.92,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "All because he trained his mouth to talk",
      "start": 588.56,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "English.",
      "start": 591.48,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "If he can do it, so can you.",
      "start": 592.88,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "But training your mouth is not just",
      "start": 595.8,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "about speaking alone. It is about",
      "start": 597.48,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "building a complete system.",
      "start": 599.88,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen to English podcasts while you",
      "start": 602.32,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "walk or cook or travel. Do not just",
      "start": 604.24,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "listen passively. Repeat the sentences",
      "start": 607.2,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "out loud. Mimic the intonation, the",
      "start": 610.12,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "rhythm, the pauses.",
      "start": 613.08,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Your ears train your mouth.",
      "start": 615.28,
      "duration": 6.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Read books out loud. Yes, out loud.",
      "start": 618.32,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with simple children's stories if",
      "start": 621.96,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "you must. Then move to newspapers,",
      "start": 624.12,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "novels, anything that interests you.",
      "start": 626.4,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Feel the words vibrate in your throat.",
      "start": 629.16,
      "duration": 6.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Your mouth needs to feel English, not",
      "start": 632.16,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "just think it.",
      "start": 635.32,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Find a language partner. Even if it is",
      "start": 637.04,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "through video calls with someone across",
      "start": 639.56,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "the ocean.",
      "start": 641.48,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Commit to speaking only English for 30",
      "start": 642.88,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "minutes every day. No switching back to",
      "start": 645.72,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "your native language when it gets hard.",
      "start": 648.08,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Push through. That discomfort is where",
      "start": 650.76,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "growth happens.",
      "start": 653.56,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I want you to feel the urgency here. The",
      "start": 655.24,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "world is moving fast. Artificial",
      "start": 657.92,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "intelligence, global businesses,",
      "start": 660.68,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "international collaborations, they all",
      "start": 662.96,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "run on English.",
      "start": 665.4,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "If your mouth cannot keep up,",
      "start": 667.04,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "opportunities will pass you by.",
      "start": 669.16,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "But if you train it now, doors will",
      "start": 671.88,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "swing open.",
      "start": 674.44,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine negotiating a business deal in",
      "start": 676.2,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "English and watching the other party",
      "start": 678.36,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "respect you instantly.",
      "start": 680.68,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine giving a presentation that",
      "start": 682.92,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "leaves everyone inspired.",
      "start": 684.64,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine traveling to any country and",
      "start": 687.04,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "making friends because your English",
      "start": 689.32,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "flows naturally.",
      "start": 691.12,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "These are not distant dreams. They are",
      "start": 693.12,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "the direct result of training your mouth",
      "start": 695.72,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "today.",
      "start": 698.56,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Let us talk about the obstacles you will",
      "start": 700.36,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "face because I want you to be ready.",
      "start": 702.16,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be days when you feel lazy.",
      "start": 705.28,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Days when your accent feels heavier than",
      "start": 708.2,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "usual.",
      "start": 710.44,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Days when you compare yourself to native",
      "start": 711.88,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "speakers and feel discouraged.",
      "start": 713.88,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Push through those days. That is when",
      "start": 716.52,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "real champions are made.",
      "start": 719.16,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Remind yourself why you started. Write",
      "start": 721.4,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "your reasons down and read them out loud",
      "start": 724.32,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "in English every morning.",
      "start": 726.56,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I am training my mouth to talk English",
      "start": 729.16,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "because I deserve a better life.",
      "start": 731.52,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Because my family deserves more.",
      "start": 734.28,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Because my dreams are bigger than my",
      "start": 737.2,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "fears.",
      "start": 739.2,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak those words with fire in your",
      "start": 740.72,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "voice. Let your mouth feel the power of",
      "start": 742.92,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "purpose.",
      "start": 746.12,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Another obstacle is perfectionism.",
      "start": 748.12,
      "duration": 6.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people wait until they feel ready",
      "start": 751.32,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "before they speak.",
      "start": 754.28,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "That day never comes.",
      "start": 755.96,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Start speaking now, imperfectly.",
      "start": 758.04,
      "duration": 6.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Your mouth will improve through use, not",
      "start": 761.6,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "through waiting.",
      "start": 764.64,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Record yourself every week and compare",
      "start": 766.16,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "week one to week four.",
      "start": 768.4,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "You will be shocked at the progress.",
      "start": 770.76,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Celebrate small wins. When you finally",
      "start": 773.76,
      "duration": 5.079
    },
    {
      "text": "pronounce a difficult word correctly,",
      "start": 776.8,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "cheer out loud.",
      "start": 778.839,
      "duration": 3.761
    },
    {
      "text": "When a full sentence flows without",
      "start": 780.76,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "hesitation, pat yourself on the back.",
      "start": 782.6,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Your brain needs positive reinforcement",
      "start": 785.92,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "and your mouth needs to associate",
      "start": 788.32,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "English with joy, not fear. Now, I want",
      "start": 790.24,
      "duration": 6.44
    },
    {
      "text": "to give you a practical 30-day challenge",
      "start": 793.08,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "that will transform you if you follow it",
      "start": 796.68,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "with discipline.",
      "start": 799.36,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Day 1 to day 10.",
      "start": 801.36,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Mirror practice.",
      "start": 804.2,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "10 minutes every morning describing your",
      "start": 806.32,
      "duration": 6.68
    },
    {
      "text": "day, your feelings, your goals. Record",
      "start": 809.0,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "and review.",
      "start": 813.0,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Day 11 to day 20.",
      "start": 814.88,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Shadowing.",
      "start": 817.2,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose one English video or podcast",
      "start": 818.8,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "every day.",
      "start": 821.2,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Play a sentence, pause, repeat exactly.",
      "start": 822.48,
      "duration": 7.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Do this for 30 minutes.",
      "start": 826.8,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Day 21 to day 30.",
      "start": 830.04,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Real conversation.",
      "start": 832.52,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Find a partner or join an online group",
      "start": 834.36,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "and speak only English for at least 20",
      "start": 837.64,
      "duration": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "minutes daily. No excuses.",
      "start": 840.64,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "At the end of 30 days, your mouth will",
      "start": 844.12,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "have changed.",
      "start": 846.44,
      "duration": 4.399
    },
    {
      "text": "You will feel it. People around you will",
      "start": 848.12,
      "duration": 4.839
    },
    {
      "text": "notice it. And that is just the",
      "start": 850.839,
      "duration": 4.081
    },
    {
      "text": "beginning.",
      "start": 852.959,
      "duration": 3.801
    },
    {
      "text": "Friends, I have seen this transformation",
      "start": 854.92,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "happen thousands of times.",
      "start": 856.76,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I have watched quiet, hesitant voices",
      "start": 859.32,
      "duration": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "turn into bold, inspiring ones.",
      "start": 862.36,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I have seen young people from villages",
      "start": 865.8,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "and small cities rise to positions of",
      "start": 868.2,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "leadership because they trained their",
      "start": 870.4,
      "duration": 4.559
    },
    {
      "text": "mouths to speak English. The power is",
      "start": 872.56,
      "duration": 4.279
    },
    {
      "text": "inside you already.",
      "start": 874.959,
      "duration": 4.361
    },
    {
      "text": "Your mouth is capable. Your brain is",
      "start": 876.839,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "capable. The only thing missing is",
      "start": 879.32,
      "duration": 5.96
    },
    {
      "text": "consistent, deliberate training.",
      "start": 881.839,
      "duration": 6.401
    },
    {
      "text": "Start today. Right after this speech, go",
      "start": 885.28,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "home and speak your first English",
      "start": 888.24,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "sentence out loud with full commitment.",
      "start": 890.8,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Tell your reflection, \"I am training my",
      "start": 894.04,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "mouth to talk English and nothing will",
      "start": 896.4,
      "duration": 4.679
    },
    {
      "text": "stop me.\"",
      "start": 899.0,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me leave you with this final",
      "start": 901.079,
      "duration": 4.081
    },
    {
      "text": "thought. Your mouth is the gateway to",
      "start": 902.52,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "your future.",
      "start": 905.16,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Every word you speak in English from now",
      "start": 906.64,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "on is a step toward the life you",
      "start": 909.24,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "deserve.",
      "start": 911.8,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Every practice session is an investment",
      "start": 913.2,
      "duration": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "in yourself that no one can take away.",
      "start": 915.88,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "The world needs your voice.",
      "start": 919.68,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "The world needs your ideas.",
      "start": 922.12,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "The world needs you to stop hiding",
      "start": 924.76,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "behind silence and start expressing",
      "start": 927.64,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself with clarity and confidence.",
      "start": 930.04,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Train your mouth. Train it hard. Train",
      "start": 933.56,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "it daily. Train it until English feels",
      "start": 936.76,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "as natural as breathing.",
      "start": 939.68,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Because when your mouth finally speaks",
      "start": 942.28,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "English fluently, your dreams will start",
      "start": 944.36,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "speaking back to you in ways you never",
      "start": 947.44,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "imagined. You have the power. You have",
      "start": 950.4,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "the potential. Now go and use it.",
      "start": 953.44,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Stand up. Open your mouth and let the",
      "start": 956.6,
